    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Local Webhook Test Workflow\n\nThis workflow verifies Issue #23 by confirming that a local n8n webhook can receive and process POST requests without being exposed externally.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. **Webhook Listener (`POST /internal/test`)**  \n   Receives a local JSON payload.\n\n2. **JavaScript Node**  \n   Processes and normalizes the received data and adds a server timestamp.\n\n3. **Manual Trigger + HTTP Request**  \n   Sends a local POST request to `http://localhost:5678/webhook/internal/test` to validate that the webhook works locally.\n\n## Result\n\nLocal webhook functionality works correctly and remains local-only.\n",
        "height": 672,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
